# The addons a client release ships, one id per line, taken from the addons repository
# (build.xml: addons.repo, ../brodgar-io-client-addons by default). Each ships with the
# addons its manifest names in "dependencies", so a bundle ships with every addon it
# includes; the dependencies of those are not followed, and one they need is listed here.
# A line starting with # is a comment; an empty list ships none. They travel in
# release-addons/ beside the client, which installs each into its addons folder once, at
# the first start that finds it, with the permissions that copy declares granted, and then
# removes release-addons/.
brodgar-ui
